use firn/tags

gnumake is a Module
gnumake is tagged doom-emacs

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.gnumake.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.gnumake]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."gnumake"."enable": enable "GNU Make build tool"
